      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Precamber (EN 1990 A1.4.3): w_max = w_tot − w_c. w_c = share c_cam of the self-weight (g_0) deflection plus the fixed value w_c.0, both in the shape of that deflection.",
