        "baseline": 18,
        "latex": "\\delta_{g.v}\\coloneq \\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ c_{prop}\\ge1\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\overrightarrow{\\frac{g_0 x_v\\left(L^3-2Lx_v^2+x_v^3\\right)}{24E_a I_L}}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\overrightarrow{\\frac{g_0 x_v\\left(L^3-2Lx_v^2+x_v^3\\right)}{24E_a I_a}}\\right.\\end{array}",
