        "h": 21,
        "html": "4.10 Natural frequency (SLS, SCI P354 approximation)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_sz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27771,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Walking vibration: f1 = 18 / sqrt(δ), δ in mm, the midspan deflection under the mass loads (G + ψ_vib Q, self-weight included).",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27796,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "Dynamic section: uncracked, full interaction. Default E_c.dyn = 38 GPa for normal-weight concrete: SCI P354 (Design of floors for vibration, 2009) and SCI AD 433; the 10% enhancement is not applied. Other practice: AISC DG11 uses 1.35 E_cm (about 44.6 GPa for C30/37); 1.0 E_cm gives the lower bound. Light-weight concrete: use the project or supplier value. Concrete in the ribs is not counted. Edit E_c.dyn in 1.10 to follow another standard.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27849,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Dynamic modular ratio",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t2",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 27821,
      "props": {
        "w": 157,
        "h": 39,
        "baseline": 21,
        "latex": "n_{dyn}\\coloneq \\frac{E_a}{E_{c.dyn}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t1"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27884,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Transformed slab area (concrete above the deck)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t4",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 27873,
      "props": {
        "w": 236,
        "h": 42,
        "baseline": 24,
        "latex": "A_{c.dyn}\\coloneq \\frac{b_{eff}h_t}{n_{dyn}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm^2",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 27921,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Elastic NA below slab top",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t6",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 27949,
      "props": {
        "w": 351,
        "h": 43,
        "baseline": 25,
        "latex": "y_{dyn}\\coloneq \\frac{A_a\\left(h_c+h_a/2\\right)+A_{c.dyn}h_t/2}{A_a+A_{c.dyn}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t5"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 28164,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Second moment, dynamic",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t8",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 28191,
      "props": {
        "w": 592,
        "h": 44,
        "baseline": 26,
        "latex": "I_{dyn}\\coloneq I_a+A_a\\left(h_c+\\frac{h_a}{2}-y_{dyn}\\right)^2+\\frac{b_{eff}h_t^3}{12n_{dyn}}+A_{c.dyn}\\left(y_{dyn}-\\frac{h_t}{2}\\right)^2",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm^4",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t7"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_t9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 28241,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Characteristic moment, g0 + G + ψ_vib Q (vibration mass)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t9"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_ta",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 28270,
      "props": {
        "w": 329,
        "h": 37,
        "baseline": 24,
        "latex": "M_{dyn.v}\\coloneq g_0\\frac{x_v\\left(L-x_v\\right)}{2}+\\mathrm{map}\\left(M_s,x_v,1,\\psi_{vib}\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formula",
        "displayUnit": "kN m",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_t9"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 28325,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Midspan deflection under the mass loads, dynamic section",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_tb"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_tc",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 28313,
      "props": {
        "w": 280,
        "h": 43,
        "baseline": 25,
        "latex": "\\delta_{dyn}\\coloneq \\frac{\\Delta x\\,\\mathrm{sum}\\left(M_{dyn.v}m_v\\right)}{E_a I_{dyn}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "mm",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_tb"
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_td",
      "type": "text",
