        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "v_Ed ≤ ν f_cd / (cot θ_f + 1/cot θ_f), i.e. cot θ_f = (ρ + √(ρ² − 4))/2 with ρ = ν f_cd / v_Ed; this needs the least steel (0.1 % margin on ρ so the strut is not left exactly at its limit). ρ &lt; 2: cot θ_f = 1, strut fails.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_ec4_vz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 29833,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Automatic strut angle for a shear stress v",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "s_ec4_pg_vz"
    },
